	(descr "Schurter MGA-A COTS+ aviation surface mount fuse, 1206, super-quick-acting FF, 125 VAC / 125 VDC across the whole 0.2-5A range, breaking capacity to 300A at 125VDC, -55 to +125C, climatic category 55/125/56, hermetically sealed ceramic body with gold-plated nickel terminals, lead-free with no tin whiskers or dendrites, qualification similar to MIL-PRF-23419, ESA ESCC 4008 thermal vacuum, 100G shock, 20G vibration, operational time 2000h at 0.63 x In at 125C. Shares the USF 1206 reflow land pattern (1.10 x 2.00mm pads on a 1.50mm gap), so it is a drop-in swap. Rating set by order number, e.g. 3-103-097 for 500mA")
